(*"experience_schema"
The subject of the *experience_schema* is the identification and characterization of types of experience or particular episodes of experience gained by persons. This schema provides for the definition of generic data relating to particular episodes of experience.

[example]
====
The identification of a particular episode of experience is an example of generic data relating to experience.
====

[example]
====
The identification of a particular type of experience is an example of generic data relating to experience.
====

*)
(*"experience_schema.__fund_cons"

This schema provides resources for the identification, naming, and description of:

* experience;
* types of experience;
* relationships between specific experiences;
* relationships between types of experience.

*)
