(*"experience_schema.experience_type"
An **experience_type** is a category of experience.
*)

(*"experience_schema.experience_type.__example"
Flying experience.
*)

(*"experience_schema.experience_type.__note"
A relationship between an *experience_type* object and one or more <<express:experience_schema.experience,experience>> objects is established by the declaration of an <<express:management_resources_schema.experience_type_assignment,experience_type_assignment>> subtype containing a single attribute that references a set of a SELECT type that contains an <<express:experience_schema.experience,experience>>.
*)

